OL,3,GNEWSAThousands at darts audition to
OL,4,Atake on Luke Littler
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of budding darts players from
OL,7,Fall over the world have been in
OL,8,FManchester aiming to qualify to play
OL,9,Fworld darts champion Luke Littler and
OL,10,Fpotentially pocket #501,000.
OL,12,FThe 19-year-old from Warrington is
OL,13,Finviting amateur players to take him on
OL,14,Fas part of a new television show Beat
OL,15,FLuke Littler.
OL,17,FSixteen-times World Darts Champion Phil
OL,18,F"The Power" Taylor was a judge at the
OL,19,Fsecond and final audition at Manchester
OL,20,FCentral Convention Complex which
OL,21,Fattracted entries from as far afield as
OL,22,FAustralia.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
