OL,3,GNEWSAThousands at darts audition to
OL,4,Atake on Luke Littler
OL,5,
OL,6,FTaylor said the talent across the two
OL,7,Fauditions - with the first one held in
OL,8,FLondon last weekend - had been
OL,9,F"incredible" and said Littler would
OL,10,Fhave his work cut out to stay
OL,11,Fundefeated.
